ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp075: TWO distinct PLANE entities at Z=0 (surf_A, surf_B); defect edge on surf_A and a matching edge on surf_B share the identical 3D line segment (0,0,0)-(4,0,0); CheckOverlapping uses surface-metadata identity and misses 3D coincidence; defect edge 3D curve is degree-2 B-spline with C-1 positional break at t=0.5 (CP[2]=(1.5,0,0) vs CP[3]=(3.0,0,0), 1.5-unit gap) driving OCC shape_null=True */
